      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَوْمٌ</span></b>  <i>A large herd of camels,</i> (S, M, K,)
<i>amounting to a thousand:</i> (M, K:) or <i>an indefinite number;</i> (K, * TA;) i. e. <i>many:</i> a quasipl. n.; or, as some say, a pl. (TA.)

